@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Issue #4 — proposed persistent professor-profile edit (not implemented)
actor Professor
boundary "Professor profile UI\n(proposed)" as UI
control "Profile data-access adapter\n(proposed)" as Adapter
control "Authenticated profile service\n(proposed)" as Service
database "Team-selected database\n(not configured)" as DB

note over Professor,DB
  Future design after model approval and database choice.
  Current branch has no professor profile UI or backend.
  Photo upload and post editing are separate flows.
end note
Professor -> UI: Open profile
UI -> Adapter: getMyProfile()
Adapter -> Service: Read profile using authenticated session
Service -> Service: Verify session + professor role
alt Invalid session or role
  Service --> Adapter: Unauthorized / forbidden
  Adapter --> UI: Show sign-in / access error
else Authorized
  Service -> DB: Read ProfessorProfile by session userId
  DB --> Service: Profile + version, or not found
  Service --> Adapter: Profile DTO or missing-profile response
  Adapter --> UI: Display profile or create-profile prompt
end

Professor -> UI: Edit fields and select Save
UI -> UI: Trim inputs; validate required name and formats
alt Invalid input
  UI --> Professor: Show field errors; preserve edits
else Valid input
  UI -> Adapter: updateMyProfile(fields, expectedVersion)
  Adapter -> Service: Update profile using session + expectedVersion
  Service -> Service: Recheck session, role, owner; validate allowlisted fields
  alt Unauthorized or invalid fields
    Service --> Adapter: Forbidden / validation error; no write
    Adapter --> UI: Preserve edits; show error
  else Authorized and valid
    Service -> DB: Atomic conditional update\nWHERE userId = session.userId AND version = expectedVersion\nSET fields, version = version + 1, updatedAt = server time
    alt Version changed or profile deleted
      DB --> Service: No row/document matched
      Service --> Adapter: Conflict / missing profile
      Adapter --> UI: Preserve edits; offer reload
    else Storage failure
      DB --> Service: Update aborted; previous profile intact
      Service --> Adapter: Retryable error
      Adapter --> UI: Preserve edits; show retry action
    else Update committed
      DB --> Service: Saved ProfessorProfile + new version
      Service --> Adapter: Saved profile DTO
      Adapter --> UI: Render confirmed values and success notice
      UI --> Professor: Changes saved
    end
  end
end
@enduml
